ushed-to-safety-of-bonds-get-rattled-in-reversal", "excerpt": "A recent influx of bullish positioning across the US bond market just got smacked, as comments from a pair of Federal Reserve officials and fresh evidence of sticky inflation increased the odds of interest-rate hikes, sending Treasuries into a tailspin.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T21:30:31.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Asian Stocks Rise on AI Enthusiasm, Bonds Decline: Markets Wrap", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-10/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates", "excerpt": "Asian stocks climbed after better-than-expected earnings from CoreWeave Inc. revived interest in the artificial intelligence trade, helping offset a Wall Street selloff fueled by hotter-than-expected US inflation.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T22:32:05.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "SoftBank Group Shares Drop 11% After Booking $7 Billion Loss", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-11/softbank-group-shares-drop-10-after-booking-7-billion-loss", "excerpt": "SoftBank Group Corp. shares dropped as much as 11% after the Japanese tech investor reported its first net loss in almost two years, after a $3.7 billion writedown for its US data-center projects and falling AI valuations.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T00:30:53.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "软银集团录得近两年来首次净亏损，并对美国数据中心项目计提37亿美元减值，同时AI估值下滑，股价一度下跌11%。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Australia’s Home Loans Fall by Record After Rapid RBA Rate Hikes", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-11/australia-s-home-loans-fall-by-record-after-rapid-rba-rate-hikes", "excerpt": "Australian home loans posted a record drop in the third quarter, underscoring the erosion of borrowing demand in response to the Reserve Bank’s aggressive interest-rate increases to control inflation.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T00:49:42.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "澳大利亚第三季度住房贷款出现创纪录下滑，反映澳洲联储为抑制通胀而大幅加息后，借贷需求明显走弱。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "CD&R’s Cornerstone to Go Ahead With Monarch Deal to Raise Money", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-11/cd-r-s-cornerstone-to-go-ahead-with-monarch-deal-to-raise-money", "excerpt": "Cornerstone Building Brands Inc. is set to move forward on a deal it reached with Monarch Alternative Capital to raise additional liquidity after months of negotiations with existing lenders, according to people familiar with the matter.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T00:31:37.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "据知情人士透露，Cornerstone Building Brands 在与现有贷款方谈判数月后，将推进与 Monarch Alternative Capital 达成的融资协议，以补充流动性。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "China’s Copper Crunch Puts Industry on Defensive as Costs Soar", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-11/china-s-copper-crunch-puts-industry-on-defensive-as-costs-soar", "excerpt": "China’s copper crunch is squeezing activity and margins at the firms that shape the metal into wires, rods and tubes for use in products from cables to electronics and consumer goods.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T00:24:07.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "中国铜供应紧张推高成本，压缩将铜加工为电线、铜杆和铜管的企业的开工率与利润率，行业被迫转向防御。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Breaking Down Anthropic's $1.4 Trillion IPO Valuation", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-11/breaking-down-anthropic-s-1-4-trillion-ipo-valuation-video", "excerpt": "Anthropic is preparing to price its initial public offering on November 18, targeting a fully diluted valuation of about $1.4 trillion and raising up to $90.4 billion to fund computing capacity for frontier AI models. Bloomberg’s Michael Shepard discusses the deal structure and whether the artificia", "publishedAt": "2026-11-11T00:00:14.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "Anthropic 计划于11月18日为 IPO 定价，目标完全稀释估值约1.4万亿美元，拟最高募资904亿美元，用于前沿AI模型的算力建设。"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Nvidia Turmoil Raises Stakes for the US-China Tech Rivalry", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-10/insight-with-haslinda-amin-11-9-2026-video", "excerpt": "\"Insight with Haslinda Amin\" is a daily news program featuring in-depth, high-profile interviews and analysis to give viewers the complete picture on the stories that matter. The show features prominent leaders spanning the worlds of business, finance, politics and culture. (Source: Bloomberg)", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T07:39:13.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets"}, {"sourceId": "bloomberg-markets", "title": "Equity Dispersion Trade Risks a Blowup, Hedge Fund CEO Warns", "url": "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-10/equity-dispersion-trade-risks-a-blowup-hedge-fund-ceo-warns", "excerpt": "Investors enjoying a golden era for the equity dispersion trade should be braced for pain if the market shifts suddenly, according to a hedge fund manager.", "publishedAt": "2026-11-10T23:52:41.000Z", "category": "finance", "source": "Bloomberg Markets", "summary": "一位对冲基金高管警告，当前处于黄金期的股票离散度交易若遇市场突然转向，投资者可能面临剧烈亏损。"}], "overview": "今日科技与资本高度交织。技术侧，DeepMind 发布 Gemini 4 Carbon 与 AlphaProof Code，后者用 Lean 验证 Signal 核心加密代码，标志 AI 深入软件验证；开源社区则聚焦 agent 技能库与可定制设计系统。财经侧，Anthropic 将 IPO 估值目标推高至约 1.4 万亿美元，拟募资至多 904 亿美元；软银因数据中心减记录得 70 亿美元净亏损、股价一度跌 11%；英伟达因黄仁勋婚外情涉间谍传闻聘请律所调查，股价承压。时政侧，美众议院暂时否决对防长赫格塞思的弹劾动议；美俄乌在阿布扎比举行三方会谈，分歧仍大；美方指控三名伊朗背景人员策划针对英国空军基地的袭击。", "market": {"market_overview": "本轮技术面整体偏分歧：美股方面，标普SPY与纳指QQQ分别位于SMA20(760.69/700.86)与SMA50下方，RSI14为44.6与40.1，趋势标签均为中性，但个股分化明显——AAPL多头排列且贴近52周高，NVDA 5日跌18.29%、RSI23.9超卖，GOOGL为空头排列加死叉。加密板块最弱：恐慌贪婪指数29处恐慌，总市值2.47T、24h跌4.55%，BTC主导率59.7%，ETH RSI29.9、SOL RSI24.2双双超卖且触发MACD死叉，BTC RSI33.8亦逼近超卖。中概股分化，BABA日内